@host = http://localhost:8080

### Gerar token (somente dev). Copie o resultado para @token abaixo
GET {{host}}/dev/token

###
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Importar leads (acao: ignorar | completar_campos_vazios | criar_mesmo_assim)
POST {{host}}/leads/importacoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="acao"

ignorar
--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="arquivo"; filename="leads.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./leads.csv
--Boundary--

### Importar leads com criar_mesmo_assim
POST {{host}}/leads/importacoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="acao"

criar_mesmo_assim
--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="arquivo"; filename="leads.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./leads.csv
--Boundary--

### Excluir lead (substitua o id)
DELETE {{host}}/leads/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
